    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/271772569b8f22ae66f2cc511fca4754.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your board game cafe to life in the vibrant seaside town of Pebblebrook! Spend your time managing your cafe, completing quests to unlock new items and exploring the town and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/c9938026fdde6b0b3581b6444e58184d.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 Food and Drink Items</strong><br>Bake, brew, and create your own personalised cafe menu with a wide variety of seasonal recipes<strong> </strong>to unlock and discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/7aec18f25a8b5b35e50384dda793152b.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Board Game Collection</strong><br>Discover and unlock 100+ board games - match them with menu items to generate special effects in your cafe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/5b0ea86b8c9486a159f1cc5a79e24377.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow or Source Ingredients</strong><br>Harvest your own crops or source ingredients from the local market shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/728fc323385d88f71005ca4291eb959f.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offer Takeaway and Delivery Services</strong><br>Fulfill customer orders outside the cafe and expand your customer reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Community Quests &amp; Events</strong>\u00a0<br>Help locals, earn rewards, and unlock content by connecting with the town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise your cafe</strong><br>Create themed caf\u00e9s paired with board game genres or design your own style (decor items will be added incrementally).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/721f905284d583c78b4c2d624c019996.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Pebblebrook</strong><br>Discover the vibrant seaside town, meet locals, build friendships, and uncover secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/b5ff702e0487db849c3f3de351ee77bc.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/271772569b8f22ae66f2cc511fca4754.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your board game cafe to life in the vibrant seaside town of Pebblebrook! Spend your time managing your cafe, completing quests to unlock new items and exploring the town and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/c9938026fdde6b0b3581b6444e58184d.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 Food and Drink Items</strong><br>Bake, brew, and create your own personalised cafe menu with a wide variety of seasonal recipes<strong> </strong>to unlock and discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/7aec18f25a8b5b35e50384dda793152b.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Board Game Collection</strong><br>Discover and unlock 100+ board games - match them with menu items to generate special effects in your cafe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/5b0ea86b8c9486a159f1cc5a79e24377.avif?t=1754489666\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow or Source Ingredients</strong><br>Harvest your own crops or source ingredients from the local market shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/728fc323385d88f71005ca4291eb959f.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offer Takeaway and Delivery Services</strong><br>Fulfill customer orders outside the cafe and expand your customer reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Community Quests &amp; Events</strong>\u00a0<br>Help locals, earn rewards, and unlock content by connecting with the town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise your cafe</strong><br>Create themed caf\u00e9s paired with board game genres or design your own style (decor items will be added incrementally).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/721f905284d583c78b4c2d624c019996.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Pebblebrook</strong><br>Discover the vibrant seaside town, meet locals, build friendships, and uncover secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/b5ff702e0487db849c3f3de351ee77bc.avif?t=1754489666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
